  "findings": [
    "All four outputs executed successfully; original Official EX and Contract are false in every arm.",
    "md-234 Gold returns two distinct coordinate rows without answering the requested count. Forge returns two coordinate groups plus counts; Direct returns three circuit groups plus counts. No generated count is automatically deleted to match Gold.",
    "md-447 both candidates select DOCType; Gold selects DOC. Metadata explicitly defines the former as a text description and the latter as a numeric category code stored as text. Replacing only that projection offline yields the exact Gold row multiset in both arms. No output normalization or scoring change was adopted.",
    "The four current prompts match the corresponding seed48 prompts byte-for-byte by SHA-256. This does not make a new stochastic response a causal reliability comparison."
  ],
